---
// No-JS fallback for SeeItWorking.astro: show the first step of all three examples, stacked, and
// hide the tabs (they need JS). Goes in the page head, where <style> inside <noscript> is valid.
---

<noscript>
  <style>
    #see-it-working .tabs { display: none; }
    #see-it-working .example[hidden] { display: block; }
    #see-it-working .example { margin-top: 36px; }
  </style>
</noscript>
